# Sorskoot BJS Engine

This is the source code for the Sorskoot BJS Engine, a powerful and versatile game engine built on top of Babylon.js. The engine provides a wide range of features and tools to help developers create stunning 3D games and applications with ease.
Blender plugin:
     [x] Store ID, Tag(s) and more in global repositor to be able to query them and work with the exported data from code.
