Ideas and features:
    [] Textured area lights
    [] Volumetric lighting
    [] recastnav support
    [] Physics support
    [] Gaussian splat support
    [] Frame Graph support
    [] Animation Retargeting
    [] Babylon Behaviors
    [] Reflection probes
    [] Global Illumination
    [] LUTs
    [] (East) Flipbook support
    [] Easy way show text/popup in front of the VR camera.
        Maybe with Babylon Behavior?

